# Normally you do NOT need this file: the app and the API are served from the
# same origin (the Render service), so the built app calls "/api/urls"
# relative to its own host and works with no configuration.
#
# Only set this if you build and host the React app on a DIFFERENT origin than
# the API (e.g. on Vercel). The value is baked in at build time:
#   Example: https://your-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
